@Backend = http://localhost:5000
@ContentType = application/json

### Get all machines
GET {{Backend}}/api/machines
Accept: {{ContentType}}

### Get machine params by ID
GET {{Backend}}/api/machines/123/params
Accept: {{ContentType}}

### Submit feedback/suggestion
POST {{Backend}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
  "machineId": "123",
  "suggestion": "Add payment method"
}

###